Step 1: Find Name collisons

SRC1="images4/Dropbox_2021_imac/Dropbox"
SRC2="images4/macbook2012/Dropbox/Camera Uploads"   # macbook, not macbo

for y in 2014 2015 2016 2017 2018 2019 2020 2021; do
  echo "== $y"; rsync -anic --existing "$SRC1/$y/" "images4/photos/$y/"
done
for y in 2011 2012 2013; do
  echo "== $y"; rsync -anic --existing "$SRC2/$y/" "images4/photos/$y/"
done

RESOLVED

Step 2: Dry run (changes nothing)

CMPTR="/Volumes/mac24/a/projects/photos_now/"
SRC1="${CMPTR}images4/Dropbox_2021_imac/Dropbox"
SRC2="${CMPTR}images4/macbook2012/Dropbox/Camera Uploads"
DEST="${CMPTR}images4/photos"

for y in 2014 2015 2016 2017 2018 2019 2020 2021; do
  echo "== $y"; rsync -ani --ignore-existing "$SRC1/$y/" "$DEST/$y/"
done

for y in 2011 2012 2013; do
  echo "== $y"; rsync -ani --ignore-existing "$SRC2/$y/" "$DEST/$y/"
done

The -n keeps this a dry run, so it is safe to paste as is.
- --ignore-existing never touches a file that's already in photos.
- 2020/shed comes along automatically, since -a recurses.

